    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Good Day Fishing is a gamified focus tool where you catch fish while completing real-life tasks. Reel in and record new species, decorate your favorite cozy fishing spot, and customize your soundscape to create a custom vibe to help you relax and boost concentration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE UNIQUE FISHING LOCATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/349f58e6342844ca3d1e1f5d3d39ed0f.poster.avif?t=1754544784\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/349f58e6342844ca3d1e1f5d3d39ed0f.webm?t=1754544784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/349f58e6342844ca3d1e1f5d3d39ed0f.mp4?t=1754544784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new bait and tackle, catch unique fish at your favorite fishing spot, and keep track of your best catches! All while staying on top of your real-world tasks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RELAXING ATMOSPHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your in-game ambiance to your taste with dozens of cozy visual/audio effect combinations including cozy activities, weather, and even the time of day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/6b53059aa063e1b0261ce0f040b784e0.poster.avif?t=1754544784\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/6b53059aa063e1b0261ce0f040b784e0.webm?t=1754544784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/6b53059aa063e1b0261ce0f040b784e0.mp4?t=1754544784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPROVE FOCUS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Good Day Fishing is designed to help you have better days:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Pomodoro, meditation, and sleep fishing timers to facilitate your day-to-day accomplishments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your todo list</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize  effects and animations to promote a state of flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress idly and interactively </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/9a8e7640df0a10f054db6c3068046436.avif?t=1754544784\" data-has-big width=800 height=284 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADORABLE CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your appearance and decorate your fishing camp\u00a0with your hard earned fish coins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FROG?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a frog. Batteries not included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/1c2495dc5e165216337b3710ff9cba24.avif?t=1754544784\" width=620 height=220 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Good Day Fishing is a gamified focus tool where you catch fish while completing real-life tasks. Reel in and record new species, decorate your favorite cozy fishing spot, and customize your soundscape to create a custom vibe to help you relax and boost concentration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE UNIQUE FISHING LOCATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/349f58e6342844ca3d1e1f5d3d39ed0f.poster.avif?t=1754544784\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/349f58e6342844ca3d1e1f5d3d39ed0f.webm?t=1754544784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/349f58e6342844ca3d1e1f5d3d39ed0f.mp4?t=1754544784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new bait and tackle, catch unique fish at your favorite fishing spot, and keep track of your best catches! All while staying on top of your real-world tasks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RELAXING ATMOSPHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your in-game ambiance to your taste with dozens of cozy visual/audio effect combinations including cozy activities, weather, and even the time of day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/6b53059aa063e1b0261ce0f040b784e0.poster.avif?t=1754544784\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/6b53059aa063e1b0261ce0f040b784e0.webm?t=1754544784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/6b53059aa063e1b0261ce0f040b784e0.mp4?t=1754544784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPROVE FOCUS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Good Day Fishing is designed to help you have better days:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Pomodoro, meditation, and sleep fishing timers to facilitate your day-to-day accomplishments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your todo list</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize  effects and animations to promote a state of flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress idly and interactively </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/9a8e7640df0a10f054db6c3068046436.avif?t=1754544784\" data-has-big width=800 height=284 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADORABLE CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your appearance and decorate your fishing camp\u00a0with your hard earned fish coins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FROG?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a frog. Batteries not included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649860/extras/1c2495dc5e165216337b3710ff9cba24.avif?t=1754544784\" width=620 height=220 /></span></p>",
